cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Volume Grating Explorer (psmgrating)
message: If you use this software, please cite the paper below and this repository.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Amos Sureshkumar
    given-names: Vivian
    affiliation: Holography Research Group, De Montfort University, Leicester, UK
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-13
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/vivian4fb/PSM_hosting
abstract: >
  Independent implementation of the parallel-stacked-mirror (PSM, PSM*) models,
  Kogelnik's coupled-wave theory, a truncated coupled-wave theory (TCWT) and a
  rigorous coupled-wave (RCWA) reference for slanted, absorbing planar volume
  gratings, validated against the printed values of the paper cited below.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Slanted planar volume gratings: parallel-stacked-mirror models versus traditional coupled wave descriptions"
    authors:
      - family-names: Brotherton-Ratcliffe
        given-names: David
      - family-names: Amos Sureshkumar
        given-names: Vivian
    year: 2026
    notes: manuscript, submission pending; DOI to be added at publication
